    {
        "content": "<p>xia-chao opened <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/14533\">PR #14533</a> from <code>xia-chao:empty-write-noop</code> to <code>bytecodealliance:main</code>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Empty writes must not trap. In <code>wasi:io</code>, <code>check-write</code> returning <code>ok(0)</code> still permits <code>len == 0</code>. The file output stream rejected an empty write while a write was in flight, aborting the guest.</p>\n</blockquote>",
        "id": 629209835,
        "sender_full_name": "Wasmtime GitHub notifications bot",
        "timestamp": 1791199662
    },
